{"id":"3b00d8ba9ccb238d","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-provable.md","title":"相对于明确演绎系统的可证性","display":"df-provable — 相对于明确演绎系统的可证性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-provable","aliases":["56-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — 相对于明确演绎系统的可证性","depends_on":["[[56-df-sentence]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — 相对于明确演绎系统的可证性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" href=\"?note=2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" title=\"56-df-sentence\">56-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" href=\"?note=2b86695d5c9cd5ac\" title=\"56-df-sentence\">56-df-sentence</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>给定演绎系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Inf})\">\\(\\mathcal C=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Inf})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Inf}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。有限序列采用从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始的索引，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i&lt;n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；推理规则的前提按索引函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:[k]\\to[i]\">\\(j:[k]\\to[i]\\)</span> 从先前各行选取，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Phi,\\pi,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^n\\land\\pi_{n-1}=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in\\Phi\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists j\\in[i]^{[k]}\\;\n(((\\pi_{j(r)})_{r\\in[k]},\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Inf})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Phi,\\pi,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^n\\land\\pi_{n-1}=\\varphi\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in\\Phi\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists j\\in[i]^{[k]}\\;\n(((\\pi_{j(r)})_{r\\in[k]},\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Inf})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Phi,\\pi,\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Phi,\\pi,\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是对既有错误占位 Proof(T,φ):=φ 的修复。可证性显式依赖给定的公理和规则实例；它不会凭名字就成为完整的一阶逻辑演绎系统，也不直接替代原书 Table 7.1 的等式演绎。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"2b86695d5c9cd5ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"2b86695d5c9cd5ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 见 [[56-df-sentence]]；$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(\\mathrm{Ax},\\mathrm{Inf})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inf}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:i<n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"j:[k]\\to[i]","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Phi,\\pi,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\Bigl(&\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^n\\land\\pi_{n-1}=\\varphi\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\bigl(\\pi_i\\in\\Phi\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}\\lor\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists j\\in[i]^{[k]}\\;\n(((\\pi_{j(r)})_{r\\in[k]},\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Inf})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi\\vdash_{\\mathcal C}\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L^{<\\omega}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal C}(\\Phi,\\pi,\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1821,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-325","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-provable.md]]"}],"outgoing":["2b86695d5c9cd5ac"]}